是因为想在研磨细的前提下，更好的去表现酸质，维持粉层的高度，可以尝试针对水洗处理的豆子这样冲煮看看。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXBKCuHaWibuhjsKRsO7MbBIIyU0UuH8xScg54UNF5taI3NDAa45fcnQAU86g7eJl1BcZUr3jkcog/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" style=\"white-space: normal; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n    关于 Wuri 雾芮 与 Worka Sakaro\n   </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  首先，先说一下Worka吧，Worka相当于一个村，位于Gedeb镇（耶加雪菲南边），与耶加雪菲同属于Gedeo区域下。\n  <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  Worka在Gedio语言里是Gold金子的意思，而Sakaro是很早很早就在当地有种植的一种大树的名字，所以这个村子就取了这两个名字的结合 Worka Sakaro。\n  <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RXBKCuHaWibuhjsKRsO7MbBoWTFHM0SOm12GSZILWUm71InSDN7ASFhmTiadicicFV37JxWhaPTDYPPg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\" style=\"white-space: normal; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  近些年，Worka这个名字在世界精品咖啡圈里非常的有名，其实Worka村辖属范围内有十多个咖啡处理站，Wuri就是其中之一。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  Wuri在Gedio语言里是High Elevation高海拔的意思，其种植海拔介于2000-2100 米之间，它是一个私人拥有的处理站，服务周边近850户咖农。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  Wuri也为2016年世界咖啡师冠军吴泽霖首次尝试厌氧日晒定制批次。\n  <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  这个批次是Royal Coffee2021开始新推出的一个生豆等级Grade 0， 是在Grade 1的基础上再做瑕疵和颗粒的筛选，得到更为精致细腻的一款产品。\n </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n  更多咖啡，请进入淘宝和小程序选购哦～\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  咖啡豆文章请参阅公众号的文章板块\n </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>",
